Project Setup in VSCode 

1. Add extensions 
  - Java Extension Pack (Microsoft)
  - Spring Boot Extension (VMware)

2. Restart VSCode

3. Create Spring Boot Project 
   -- (Ctrl + Shift + P) to get search box
   -- search Type:
		Spring Initializr
 
		- Select "Spring Initializr: Create a Maven Project"
		- Choose Maven
		- Java
		- Spring boot version
		- Enter Project details
			- Group ID
			- Artifact ID
			- Add Dependencies
				•	Spring Web 
				•	Spring Data JPA 
				•	PostgreSQL Driver 
				•	Lombok 
				•	Validation 
				
				
	-- Enter
	-- Choose folder where project is to be saved
	
4. Open the project
5. Add Database Configuration in application.properties
6. Select Main class and click Run button 	
	
	

